### ============================================
### FastMeals Delivery Service — REST Client
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3004
@contentType = application/json
@adminToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ──────────────────────────────────
### List All Delivery Persons
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List Active Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List Available (active + not delivering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons?available=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Get by ID
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons/COLE_UUID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Create Delivery Person
### ──────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Novo Entregador",
  "phone": "(11) 97777-8888",
  "vehicleType": "motorcycle",
  "currentLatitude": -23.5500,
  "currentLongitude": -46.6400
}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Update Delivery Person
### ──────────────────────────────────

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons/COLE_UUID_AQUI
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "isActive": false,
  "currentLatitude": -23.5600,
  "currentLongitude": -46.6500
}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Delete Delivery Person
### ──────────────────────────────────

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons/COLE_UUID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Without token (401)
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-persons